{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05098","headline":"陪幸韦嗣立山庄 · 沈佺期","name":"陪幸韦嗣立山庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台阶好赤松，别业对青峯。\n茆室承三顾，花源接九重。\n虹旗萦秀木，凤辇拂疎筇。\n迳直千官拥，溪长万骑容。\n水堂开禹膳，山阁献尧锺。\n皇监清居远，天文睿奖浓。\n岩泉他夕梦，渔钓往年逢。\n共荣丞相府，偏降逸人封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}